  "ruleText": "He-P 808.18 Quality Assessment. Licensed laboratories, including mobile laboratory vans, shall develop and implement a quality assessment program that reviews policies and services and maximizes quality by preventing or correcting identified problems.\n\nSource. #2192, eff 11-25-82; ss by #3193, eff 1-28-86; ss by #5317, EMERGENCY, eff 1-29-92, EXPIRED: 5-28-92\n\nNew. #5758, eff 12-20-93, EXPIRED: 12-20-99\n\nNew. #8409, eff 8-19-05; ss by #8852, eff 3-24-07; ss by #10267, eff 2-2-13; ss by #13710, eff 8-2-23",
